      "text": "App skeleton, .devcontainer/, AGENTS.md and role guides, CI.\nmain takes no pushes.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r64",
      "originalText": "App skeleton, .devcontainer/, AGENTS.md and role guides, CI. main takes no pushes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "bnzPwXv71NNB1LOmaN8Vl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1261,
      "y": 459,
      "width": 342,
      "height": 97.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 169023542,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1308102390,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Issues with context, goal and acceptance\ncriteria, in milestones. A milestone with a\ndue date is a release. Ready issues get\nstatus/ready.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r71",
      "originalText": "Issues with context, goal and acceptance criteria, in milestones. A milestone with a due date is a release. Ready issues get status/ready.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "Hgy5wLRJiAvoeLdqHXYki",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1713,
      "y": 459,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 72.9,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b20",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2099173610,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 948765546,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "status/* labels say where each issue is;\npriority/urgent jumps the queue. Issues can\nwait on others, across repositories.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r76",
      "originalText": "status/* labels say where each issue is; priority/urgent jumps the queue. Issues can wait on others, across repositories.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "MJ8WBsQ1TQ6LeGJVfi8hp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2153,
      "y": 459,
      "width": 598,
      "height": 97.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b21",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 375925674,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 625393718,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• No acceptance criteria: back to a person, before any tokens are spent.\n• Needs a protected file: the Task waits, the operator carries the change.\n• Usage limit or node restart: wait or run again, no round lost.\n• Out of rounds and tries: back to a person (status/needs-human).",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r79",
      "originalText": "• No acceptance criteria: back to a person, before any tokens are spent.\n• Needs a protected file: the Task waits, the operator carries the change.\n• Usage limit or node restart: wait or run again, no round lost.\n• Out of rounds and tries: back to a person (status/needs-human).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "-M8-m29dgZ1j7EDKTYkMU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1261,
      "y": 699,
      "width": 231,
      "height": 145.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b22",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1944210742,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1202521642,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Polls ready issues, waits for\ntheir dependencies, takes\nthe release due first and\nurgent first, and starts a\nTask for each, up to its\nparallel limit.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r83",
      "originalText": "Polls ready issues, waits for their dependencies, takes the release due first and urgent first, and starts a Task for each, up to its parallel limit.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "XPoiQx5dM9PChySkdTDuZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1575,
      "y": 699,
      "width": 239,
      "height": 145.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b23",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 131020406,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 439175542,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The implementer Agent\n(Claude Code, Sonnet) works\nin a sandbox pod with the\nissue, the model's context\nand its role guide, runs make\ncheck and pushes a branch.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r88",
      "originalText": "The implementer Agent (Claude Code, Sonnet) works in a sandbox pod with the issue, the model's context and its role guide, runs make check and pushes a branch.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "df_R877f6xQ-Lwzn8OTSi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1889,
      "y": 699,
      "width": 234,
      "height": 97.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b24",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2026698678,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1631498474,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The operator opens a pull\nrequest that closes the\nissue. Gitea Actions runs the\nStandard's checks.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r92",
      "originalText": "The operator opens a pull request that closes the issue. Gitea Actions runs the Standard's checks.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "DyjJQ26HdHuDU-z6GcepJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2203,
      "y": 699,
      "width": 225,
      "height": 121.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b25",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 520130806,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1542498998,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The reviewer Agent (Opus)\nchecks each acceptance\ncriterion, approves or\nrequests changes, and may\nname follow-ups.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r97",
      "originalText": "The reviewer Agent (Opus) checks each acceptance criterion, approves or requests changes, and may name follow-ups.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "gwch1wA3GFyKp3yY4DrFG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2517,
      "y": 699,
      "width": 239,
      "height": 97.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b26",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 99549750,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 416089002,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The operator squash-merges\nthe reviewed commit, closes\nthe issue and files the\nfollow-ups for later.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r101",
      "originalText": "The operator squash-merges the reviewed commit, closes the issue and files the follow-ups for later.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "X5bWaore-5NM6bFD_nn1e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 41,
      "y": 1239,
      "width": 257,
      "height": 48.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b27",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8211318,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1765139446,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A person moves the Standard's\npinned ref to a newer tag.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r116",
      "originalText": "A person moves the Standard's pinned ref to a newer tag.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "_Kkim7pohOqbdWyoHBpPh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 367,
      "y": 1239,
      "width": 256,
      "height": 121.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b28",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1022389430,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1484979818,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For each Ready Container on it,\nthe operator renders the old\nand the new ref and opens a\npull request with the\ndifference.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r120",
      "originalText": "For each Ready Container on it, the operator renders the old and the new ref and opens a pull request with the difference.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "hwqIKWwvVEyVNcP91Kq_i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 693,
      "y": 1239,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 72.9,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b29",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 58498154,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 604108086,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Merged once every required\ncheck passes. Files changed\nsince are named for a person.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r124",
      "originalText": "Merged once every required check passes. Files changed since are named for a person.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "OWO3RrHzb-nlyhX4Ic1lT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29,
      "y": 1391,
      "width": 754,
      "height": 22.950000000000003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 591494954,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 220963114,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A Relationship added after scaffolding is not applied: it shows Applied=False, AddedAfterScaffold.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r127",
      "originalText": "A Relationship added after scaffolding is not applied: it shows Applied=False, AddedAfterScaffold.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "VbAbUqWTYHqe23xsNsqbV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1081,
      "y": 1239,
      "width": 386,
      "height": 91.80000000000001,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 635177450,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1706679926,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Story view: the model and who works on what\nnow. Factory view: health, CPU and memory, Tasks\nby stage with their timelines, agent slots, what\nneeds a look.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r134",
      "originalText": "Story view: the model and who works on what now. Factory view: health, CPU and memory, Tasks by stage with their timelines, agent slots, what needs a look.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "YBfvK4ZbpJiadXOWBjwE1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1525,
      "y": 1239,
      "width": 328,
      "height": 91.80000000000001,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1918319786,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1379003370,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "People and agents work in devcontainers; a\nsmall client registers a Session and sends a\nheartbeat every 30 s. Silent for 2 minutes:\nStale.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r138",
      "originalText": "People and agents work in devcontainers; a small client registers a Session and sends a heartbeat every 30 s. Silent for 2 minutes: Stale.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "zr_GCSFZpISqezN8jH0Yk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1069,
      "y": 1391,
      "width": 666,
      "height": 22.950000000000003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1449006954,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 321036214,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Every Task keeps its timeline in status.history. make up, down and doctor run the cluster.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r139",
      "originalText": "Every Task keeps its timeline in status.history. make up, down and doctor run the cluster.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "BPGpBo1lNvvYo3LYYFIRp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1981,
      "y": 1235,
      "width": 724,
      "height": 170.1,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 842766890,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 497082026,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791061570781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• No Kubernetes credentials in the sandbox; results leave through the pod's termination\nmessage.\n• A Gitea bot user per Container, with write access to its own repository only.\n• No pushes to main: only the operator merges, and only the reviewed commit.\n• CI, the Makefile, the agents' rules and .theos.yaml change only through a gated\nStandard change.\n• A NetworkPolicy allows DNS, Gitea and public HTTPS; every run has a deadline.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r146",
      "originalText": "• No Kubernetes credentials in the sandbox; results leave through the pod's termination message.\n• A Gitea bot user per Container, with write access to its own repository only.\n• No pushes to main: only the operator merges, and only the reviewed commit.\n• CI, the Makefile, the agents' rules and .theos.yaml change only through a gated Standard change.\n• A NetworkPolicy allows DNS, Gitea and public HTTPS; every run has a deadline.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
